            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Gina"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great summer salad. Being cilantro is a semi-acquired taste I've also done this sans avocado substituting lemons for lime/juice, fresh basil for cilantro, &amp; sweet Cherubs (grape tomatoes, halved) for avocado. But I personally loved the original just the way it is. Many possibilities with fruits, herbs, &amp; juices though. Thank you for a wonderful summer salad that's out of the norm. Will use this for catering also ;)",
            "datePublished": "2014-05-05T05:18:28.183Z"
